    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present this charming two-bedroom property, set on a large private site of c.1.13-acre in the peaceful rural setting of Yellowford, Ballymacoda.\r\nBuilt in 1950, the property features a bright and welcoming open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, with double-aspect windows to the front.\r\nIdeally positioned within easy reach of Ballymacoda and Killeagh village, which benefit from local shops, services and community facilities. Youghal, approx. 12 km away, and Midleton, approx. 18 km away, offer a wider range of supermarkets, shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, healthcare and recreational facilities. \r\nThe surrounding East Cork countryside and coastline provide excellent opportunities for enjoying the outdoors, with Knockadoon Pier, Ballycotton, Garryvoe and surrounding beaches all within easy reach.\r\nAccommodation includes: Entrance Porch, Kitchen/Dining/ Living room, Utility room, 2 Bedrooms and Family Bathroom. C. 65.74 m²\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €250,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor:\r\nEntrance Porch: Wood flooring\r\n\t        \r\nKitchen/Living/ Dining:\tOpen-plan kitchen, living and dining area with a fully fitted kitchen, a breakfast bar with seating area, integrated electric oven and hob, microwave and free-standing fridge/freezer & dishwasher. The kitchen also benefits from tiled splashback. The living area features a spiral staircase leading to the first floor. Wood flooring runs throughout the space. \r\n\r\nUtility:\tPlumbed for washer and dryer. \r\n\r\n1St Floor:\r\nBedroom 1:\tSide aspect bedroom with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\tSide aspect bedroom with carpet flooring\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\tW.C., wash hand basin & bath.  Tiled floored. \r\n\r\nIncluded in Sale: \tAll curtains, carpets, blinds & light fittings.  Appliances and furniture can be negotiated at a further cost.\r\n\r\nOutside: \tThe property is approached through a gated entrance leading to a spacious private driveway and parking forecourt. The extensive grounds extend to c.1.13 acres.\r\nThe grounds offer an excellent level of privacy and provide substantial outdoor space surrounding the property, with a number of mature trees and established garden areas. There is also a block build shed garden shed.\r\n\r\nServices:\t\tPrivate well, O.F.C.H. & Well water."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tBuilt circa 1950\r\n•\tSet on a substantial c.1.13-acre site\r\n•\tSouth-westerly facing front\r\n•\tSpiral staircase leading to first-floor bedrooms\r\n•\tPrivate gated entrance\r\n•\tSpacious driveway and generous parking area\r\n•\tPeaceful rural setting\r\n•\tAttractive views over the surrounding East Cork countryside\r\n•\tConveniently located to Ballymacoda and Killeagh\r\n•\tEasy access to the N25\r\n•\tBER D2  BER NO. 109778381\r\n•\tApprox. 65.74 m² (708 sq. ft.) overall floor area"
      },
